  "summary": "RevMotion '26 social announcement square (1080x1080) accepted at iteration 003. Clean typographic poster on the Lumen Platform Default brand kit (dark navy $surface.brand artboard, Inter, tokens only), NO hero image per the deliberate decision that a typographic layout reads faster at thumbnail. Full-canvas poster idiom: hug header pinned top (RM monogram chip + RevMotion wordmark), fill-height main y(c) centering the focal block (cyan kicker 'AI-NATIVE GTM - LIVE IN SF' -> 80pt/w800 headline 'RevMotion 26' -> 32pt/w600 subtitle 'September 12-13 - San Francisco'), hug footer pinned bottom (white CTA pill 'Save your seat' with dark bold 22pt label). ABM slots bound: account.name, campaign.eyebrow, campaign.headline, offer.primary_message, campaign.cta. Iteration 001 was rejected (subtitle unreadable at 16pt, invisible dark-on-dark CTA, undersized CTA label, bottom-heavy dead band); iteration 003 repaired all four surgically via compile_dsl_block modify lines (subtitle->32pt/w600, CTA->white $surface.page pill, CTA label->22pt/w800 dark $text.primary; the enlarged subtitle plus y(c) centering resolved the vertical balance). Preflight clean (only environmental LUMB0613/0614 font warnings). Reviewer accepted with confidence 0.83, zero open issues. Final preview: .lumen-runs-C/run_85a167258f36438cbaddbb7898ac39f7/iterations/003/preview.svg (and preview.png), 1080x1080.",
